            "id": "levelled_description_aa9a932817b6",
            "level": {
              "value": 14
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You've discovered how to transform yourself into a cloud dragon. Once per day, you can cast 7th-level dragon form as an innate arcane spell, transforming into a cloud dragon. The spell automatically heightens to 8th level if you're 16th level and 9th level if you're 18th level. On a critical hit with an unarmed Strike gained from dragon form, you recharge the spell's breath weapon immediately.\n\nWhile in this form, you gain the following cloud dragon\u2013specific abilities:\n\n- **Cloud** cloud walk (you can walk on clouds or fog); **Melee** 1A jaws, **Damage** 2d10 piercing plus 1d12 electricity; **Melee** 1A claw (agile), **Damage** 3d10 slashing; **Melee** 1A tail (reach 10 feet), **Damage** 3d10 bludgeoning; **Melee** 1A horn (reach 10 feet), **Damage** 3d8 piercing; breath weapon 30-foot cone, 6d12 electricity."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
